@Fast_Bank.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5242

GET {{Fast_Bank.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

# Tarjetas de Crédito - Credit Card Operations

### Obtener información de tarjeta de crédito
GET {{Fast_Bank.API_HostAddress}}/api/tarjetascredito/TC001
Accept: application/json

### Realizar compra con tarjeta de crédito
POST {{Fast_Bank.API_HostAddress}}/api/tarjetascredito/TC001/comprar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monto": 150.00,
  "descripcion": "Compra en supermercado"
}

### Realizar pago a tarjeta de crédito
POST {{Fast_Bank.API_HostAddress}}/api/tarjetascredito/TC001/pagar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monto": 50.00
}

###
